        "content": "### Kafka partition warning\n\n`binance-collection` has 7/10 partitions assigned to removed broker IDs `1` or `2`, so they currently have no leader. Topic/consumer-lag collection is disabled to keep broker monitoring responsive. Repair requires a reviewed Kafka partition reassignment because it may affect retained data.",
